ives us some credit here but  let me know in the comments what did you  like better and why  by the way if you're interested in  learning the locker mate pavan i just  did a 40 minute video for tone bass  in which i do a deep dive into the  history  and interpretation and how to ornament  this  wonderful work so i'd recommend heading  over to their website where they have  all these incredible tutorials by some  of the world's best guitarists  so thanks so much for watching and stay  tuned because i'm going to release  the full video of me playing the loot  version and the full video of me playing  the guitar version so they can be  enjoyed on their own merits  see you guys next time  you

